  "title": "History's Strongest Disciple Kenichi 2: Masters Arc : The Koi Pond",
  "description": "Translated by The Koi Pond\nFight, O fists! Burn, heart of justice!!\nShirahama Kenichi, once an unremarkable high school student, has grown stronger under the guidance of the absurdly strong and beautiful girl Miu, spending his days training at Ryouzanpaku, where masters of various martial arts gather.\nHaving overcome countless trials and matured, a new enemy now appears before Kenichi… a ninja!?\nAnd even former comrades, as well as the arch-enemy YOMI, re-enter the fray…!!!",
